            "Purchase Price: $350,000.00\n",
            "Gross Annual Rent: $28,800.00\n",
            "Effective Gross Income (adj. vacancy): $27,360.00\n",
            "Total Annual OpEx (HOA + Mgmt + Maint): $10,438.80\n",
            "Net Operating Income (NOI): $16,921.20\n",
            "Gross Rental Yield (%): 8.23%\n",
            "Net Rental Yield (%): 4.83%\n"
          ]
